{#- v2 layout (website overhaul, 2026-10-29; creative direction "Glare to Calm").
    Pages not yet converted keep their old layout.
    Front matter:
      theme: warm        adds body.theme-warm (Warm Gallery: cream ground, for home, office, blinds)
      hero_preload: key  preloads that _data/v2images.json image as the LCP (AVIF srcset)
      hero_sizes: "..."  the sizes for that preload (default 100vw); must match the hero <img>
      header_over: true  header sits transparent over a full-bleed hero and turns solid after it
      lightdown: true    the Light-Down hero (Moment 1): adds html.ld-on before first paint when
                         motion is allowed, so the glare state paints first and settles to calm
      extra_css: [..]    page-owned stylesheets loaded after v2.css (e.g. /assets/v2/builder.css)
      extra_js: [..]     page-owned scripts, deferred, loaded last
    Reuses the existing head pieces (head/top: charset, viewport, GA4 with Consent Mode, icons;
    head/meta: title, description, canonical, Open Graph, and google-site-verification on the
    homepage via frame.json; jsonld; head/clarity) and the existing behavior scripts (gtag events,
    cookie consent, quote form submit, source and VIN, service validation). The quote form itself
    (quote.njk) is included by the page, unchanged. Styles: /assets/v2/v2.css, one file.
    Fonts preloaded: Barlow Condensed 500 (H1 and H2) and Poppins 400 (body); the 300, 600 and
    Poppins 500/600 files load on demand. -#}
{%- set w2 = pages.shared.v2 -%}
{% include "head/top.njk" %}
{% include "head/meta.njk" %}
{% if noindex %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
{% endif %}{% set ld = schema_ld %}{% include "jsonld.njk" %}
{% if lightdown %}<script>try{if(!(window.matchMedia&&matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches))document.documentElement.classList.add("ld-on")}catch(e){}</script>
{% endif %}<link rel="preload" href="/assets/v2/fonts/barlow-condensed-latin-500-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="/assets/v2/fonts/poppins-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{% if hero_preload and v2images[hero_preload] %}<link rel="preload" as="image" type="image/avif" imagesrcset="{{ v2images[hero_preload].avif }}" imagesizes="{{ hero_sizes or '100vw' }}" fetchpriority="high">
{% endif %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/v2/v2.css">
{% for css in extra_css %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ css }}">
{% endfor %}{% include "head/clarity.njk" %}
</head>
<body class="v2{% if theme == 'warm' %} theme-warm{% endif %}{% if header_over %} v2-overhero{% endif %}">
{% include "skip-link.njk" %}
{% include "v2/header.njk" %}
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
{{ content | safe }}
</main>
{% include "v2/footer.njk" %}
{% include "v2/sticky-call.njk" %}
{%- set hoursCfg = {
  "tz": site.hours.timezone or "America/Los_Angeles",
  "days": site.hours.days,
  "opens": site.hours.opens,
  "closes": site.hours.closes,
  "closures": site.closures or [],
  "unknown": site.hours_unknown or [],
  "labels": w2.status
} %}
<script type="application/json" id="bc-hours">{{ hoursCfg | jsonld | replace("<", "\\u003c") | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/v2/status.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/v2/menu.js" defer></script>
{% include "js/quote-submit.njk" %}
{% include "js/source-vin.njk" %}
{% include "js/gtag-events.njk" %}
{% include "cookie-bar.njk" %}
{% include "js/cookie.njk" %}
{% include "js/svc-validate.njk" %}
{% for js in extra_js %}<script src="{{ js }}" defer></script>
{% endfor %}</body>
</html>
